{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 3,
  "name": {
    "ja": "ログルス使い",
    "en": "Logrus Master",
  },
  "definition": {
    "type": "KILL_LEVEL",
    "level": 25,
    "maxNum": 1,
    "monster": 498,
    "flags": ["PRESET", "ONCE"],
  },
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "when": {
        "statusAtMost": "COMPLETED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "最近、街の家の一軒を怪しいよそ者が買い取りました。それ以来",
          "怪しげな事件が頻繁に起こるようになりました。",
          "動物は死に、人々は病気になり、この街では悪いことばかり起こっています。",
          "どうやらカオスの力をもてあそんでいる人間がいるようです。私はこの原因が",
          "街の北西の家に住んでいるよそ者だという証拠を持っています。",
          "どうかあのログルス使いを追い出して下さい。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "One of the houses in town was recently sold to an foreign",
          "mystic.  Now more and more alarming things happen like the",
          "sudden plague of evil in the severs, animals dying, people",
          "getting sick, and a general run of bad luck for our town.",
          "It is like someone is playing around with powers of chaos.",
          "I have evidence that the origin of everything is the stranger",
          "living in the house in the north-west corner of town.",
          "I need you to take this logrus adept out.",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "REWARDED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "また我々を窮地から救って下さい有難うございます。",
          "どうか外にあるお礼を受けとって下さい。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "You saved us from deep trouble again, please accept the",
          "gift that awaits you outside.",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "FAILED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "あなたをかいかぶっていたようですな。しかし私の友人である司書の",
          "アスティヌスから聞いた話では、あのログルス使いは街を去ったようです。",
          "彼が二度と戻ってこないことを願いましょう。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "It seems like I've overestimated your power.  But at least",
          "my friend Astinus, the Librarian says that the Logrus Master",
          "has left the town.  Let's hope that he never comes back.",
        ],
      },
    },
  ],
  "legend": {
    "a": {
      "terrain": "FLOOR",
      "caveInfo": ["ROOM"],
      "monster": 498,
    },
    "O": {
